    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "While delivering tomatoes to a chunky tomato factory, a crate tips over and breaks. A tomato rolls across the floor. In fact, it has legs and just realizes what's going on and rushes toward the factory fence. Behind the fence, a busy road awaits her. But behind it is a peaceful forest! It's up to you whether she makes it or still becomes a <strong>chunky tomato</strong>.<br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Before you unlock the goal on the other side of the road, you need to collect stars on the road.<br></li><li>On the road, not only cars are a danger. There are various obstacles that try to stop you (nails, broken glass, chewing gum...).<br></li><li>However, there is also help. Drops are scattered on the road, which will help you to improve.<br></li><li>Survive a total of 40 levels, the difficulty of which increases with each level.<br></li><li>The distribution of stars and obstacles is random, so each level is individual.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "While delivering tomatoes to a chunky tomato factory, a crate tips over and breaks. A tomato rolls across the floor. In fact, it has legs and just realizes what's going on and rushes toward the factory fence. Behind the fence, a busy road awaits her. But behind it is a peaceful forest! It's up to you whether she makes it or still becomes a <strong>chunky tomato</strong>.<br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Before you unlock the goal on the other side of the road, you need to collect stars on the road.<br></li><li>On the road, not only cars are a danger. There are various obstacles that try to stop you (nails, broken glass, chewing gum...).<br></li><li>However, there is also help. Drops are scattered on the road, which will help you to improve.<br></li><li>Survive a total of 40 levels, the difficulty of which increases with each level.<br></li><li>The distribution of stars and obstacles is random, so each level is individual.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Chunky Tomato is a platform game in which you'll help a tomato, fortunately equipped with legs, to escape from a chunky tomato factory. All you have to do is cross the road. But watch out for the cars!",
